    <values>
        <field>Description__c</field>
        <value
      xsi:type="xsd:string"
    >One batch activates N contracts in a single trigger transaction; each contract activates its 2 deals, which fire 2 record-triggered flows. BEFORE queries and updates deals contract by contract: the cascade breaks the 100-query limit and every row of the batch fails. AFTER activates all deals with one query and one partial-success update. Chaos injects one deal with no amount.</value>
    </values>
